<section class="related-detachment related-core" data-detachment="core">
      <h2>Core Stratagems</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="content-group" id="core-stratagems" data-track="core-stratagems">
<h3 class="category-title">Core Stratagems</h3>
<p class="lead">Universal Stratagems available to every army. Datasheet tools only show the cards the selected unit can legally target.</p>
<div class="detachment-content core-stratagem-grid">
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-command-re-roll">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>COMMAND RE-ROLL</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Any phase, just after you make an Advance, Charge, Damage, Hazard, Hit, Save or Wound roll for a unit from your army, or a roll to determine the number of attacks made with a weapon equipped by a model in that unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That unit or model from your army.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Re-roll that roll. If several dice were rolled, select one of them to re-roll; Charge rolls are re-rolled in full.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-epic-challenge">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>EPIC CHALLENGE</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Fight phase, just after a friendly CHARACTER unit is selected to fight.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That CHARACTER unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Select one CHARACTER model in that unit. Until the end of the phase, its melee weapons have the PRECISION ability.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-insane-bravery">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>INSANE BRAVERY</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Battle-shock step of your Command phase, just before a unit from your army takes a Battle-shock test.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>That test is automatically successful.</p>
<p class="field"><b>RESTRICTION</b><br>Once per battle.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-explosives">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>EXPLOSIVES</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One EXPLOSIVES or GRENADES unit from your army that is eligible to shoot, did not Advance this turn and is not within Engagement Range of enemy units.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Select one eligible model, then one visible enemy unit within 8&quot; and outside Engagement Range. Roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-crushing-impact">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>CRUSHING IMPACT</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Your Charge phase, just after a MONSTER or VEHICLE unit from your army ends a Charge move.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>That MONSTER or VEHICLE unit.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range and one model in your unit within Engagement Range of it. Roll a number of D6 equal to that model’s Toughness: each 1 inflicts 1 mortal wound on your unit; each 5+ inflicts 1 mortal wound on the enemy unit, to a maximum of 6.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-rapid-ingress">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>RAPID INGRESS</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>End of your opponent’s Movement phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army in Strategic Reserves, excluding AIRCRAFT.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>That unit can make an ingress move.</p>
<p class="field"><b>RESTRICTION</b><br>Cannot be used during the first battle round.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-fire-overwatch">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>FIRE OVERWATCH</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>End of your opponent’s Movement phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army, excluding TITANIC units, that is not within Engagement Range of enemy units.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Your unit can shoot one visible enemy unit within 24&quot; using Snap Shooting: only unmodified Hit rolls of 6 score a hit and Hit rolls cannot be re-rolled. After it has shot, that unit is not eligible to perform an Action this turn.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-smokescreen">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>SMOKESCREEN</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Start of your opponent’s Shooting phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One SMOKE unit from your army.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Until the end of the phase, that unit has the Benefit of Cover. In addition, a friendly unit not fully visible to the attacking unit because it is obscured by the selected SMOKE unit also has the Benefit of Cover against that attack.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-heroic-intervention">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>HEROIC INTERVENTION</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>End of your opponent’s Charge phase.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army within 12&quot; of one or more enemy units and not within Engagement Range. A VEHICLE can only be targeted if it is also a CHARACTER or WALKER.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Resolve a Charge and select one mode before the Charge roll. <b>Leap to Defend:</b> charge targets must have made a Charge move this phase and be within the maximum distance. <b>Into the Fray (+1CP):</b> if the modified Charge roll is greater than 6, change it to 6; charge targets can be any enemy units within 6&quot; and within the maximum distance.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="core-stratagem-counteroffensive">
<div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3>COUNTEROFFENSIVE</h3><span class="stratagem-type">Core Stratagem</span></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div>
<p class="field"><b>WHEN</b><br>Your opponent’s Fight step, just after an enemy unit has resolved its attacks.</p>
<p class="field"><b>TARGET</b><br>One unit from your army that is eligible to fight.</p>
<p class="field"><b>EFFECT</b><br>Your unit has Fights First and must be the next unit selected to fight.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section></div>
    </section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="virulent-vectorium">
      <h2>Virulent Vectorium</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="virulent-vectorium-stratagems" data-track="virulent-vectorium-stratagems">
<h4 class="detachment-part-title">Stratagems</h4>
<div class="detachment-content">
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-putrid-detonation">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="putrid-detonation" data-term-title="PUTRID DETONATION" data-term-summary="WHEN: Any phase. TARGET: One DEATH GUARD VEHICLE or DEATH GUARD MONSTER model from your army with the Deadly Demise ability that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that model even though it was just destroyed." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-putrid-detonation" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#stratagem-putrid-detonation">PUTRID DETONATION</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="virulent-vectorium" data-term-title="Virulent Vectorium" data-term-summary="Take and Hold, 3DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#virulent-vectorium-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#virulent-vectorium-rule">Virulent Vectorium</button> – Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">1CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Any phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>One <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-vehicle" data-term-title="VEHICLE" data-term-summary="VEHICLE units use HAZARD ROLLS, CLOSE-QUARTERS SHOOTING, MOVING MONSTERS AND VEHICLES and SHOOTING AT ENGAGED MONSTERS AND VEHICLES.">VEHICLE</button> or <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-monster" data-term-title="MONSTER" data-term-summary="MONSTER units use HAZARD ROLLS, CLOSE-QUARTERS SHOOTING, TERRAIN AND MOVEMENT and MOVING MONSTERS AND VEHICLES (+1 more).">MONSTER</button> model from your army with the <button class="term-button" data-term="core-deadly-demise" data-term-title="DEADLY DEMISE" data-term-summary="From detonating ammo stores to corrosive innards or frenzied death throes, some targets are deadly even in defeat. This ability always takes the form Deadly Demise X.…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-08">Deadly Demise</button> ability that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that model even though it was just destroyed.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Do not roll one D6 to determine whether mortal wounds are inflicted by your model’s <button class="term-button" data-term="core-deadly-demise" data-term-title="DEADLY DEMISE" data-term-summary="From detonating ammo stores to corrosive innards or frenzied death throes, some targets are deadly even in defeat. This ability always takes the form Deadly Demise X.…" data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-08">Deadly Demise</button> ability. Instead, mortal wounds are automatically inflicted. In addition, any enemy units that suffer mortal wounds as a result of this Stratagem are <button class="term-button" data-term="afflicted" data-term-title="Afflicted" data-term-summary="While an enemy unit is Afflicted, subtract 1 from its models’ Toughness and apply the effect of your chosen Plague to that unit.">Afflicted</button> until the start of your next turn.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-disgustingly-resilient">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="disgustingly-resilient" data-term-title="DISGUSTINGLY RESILIENT" data-term-summary="WHEN: Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-disgustingly-resilient" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#stratagem-disgustingly-resilient">DISGUSTINGLY RESILIENT</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="virulent-vectorium" data-term-title="Virulent Vectorium" data-term-summary="Take and Hold, 3DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#virulent-vectorium-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#virulent-vectorium-rule">Virulent Vectorium</button> – Battle Tactic Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">2CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>One <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-plaguesurge">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="plaguesurge" data-term-title="PLAGUESURGE" data-term-summary="WHEN: Your Command phase. TARGET: Your DEATH GUARD WARLORD that is on the battlefield. EFFECT: Until the start of your next Command phase, add 3&quot; to the Contagion Range of models from your army." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-plaguesurge" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#stratagem-plaguesurge">PLAGUESURGE</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="virulent-vectorium" data-term-title="Virulent Vectorium" data-term-summary="Take and Hold, 3DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#virulent-vectorium-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#virulent-vectorium-rule">Virulent Vectorium</button> – Epic Deed Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">2CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Your Command phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>Your <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> WARLORD that is on the battlefield.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Until the start of your next Command phase, add 3&quot; to the <button class="term-button" data-term="contagion-range" data-term-title="Contagion Range" data-term-summary="Contagion Range is 3&quot; in battle round 1, 6&quot; in round 2 and 9&quot; from round 3 onward; it cannot exceed 12&quot; after modifiers.">Contagion Range</button> of models from your army.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-leechspore-eruption">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="leechspore-eruption" data-term-title="LEECHSPORE ERUPTION" data-term-summary="WHEN: Your Command phase. TARGET: One DEATH GUARD model your army that has lost one or more wounds. EFFECT: Select one enemy unit within 3&quot; of your model." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-leechspore-eruption" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#stratagem-leechspore-eruption">LEECHSPORE ERUPTION</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="virulent-vectorium" data-term-title="Virulent Vectorium" data-term-summary="Take and Hold, 3DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#virulent-vectorium-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#virulent-vectorium-rule">Virulent Vectorium</button> – Epic Deed Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">1CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Your Command phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>One <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> model your army that has lost one or more wounds.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Select one enemy unit within 3&quot; of your model. Roll a number of D6 equal to the number of wounds your model has lost: for each 5+, that enemy unit suffers one mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds) and your model regains 1 lost wound (to a maximum of 6 lost wounds).</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-overwhelming-generosity">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="overwhelming-generosity" data-term-title="OVERWHELMING GENEROSITY" data-term-summary="WHEN: Start of your Shooting phase. TARGET: One DEATH GUARD CHARACTER unit from your army. EFFECT: Select one enemy unit visible to your unit." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-overwhelming-generosity" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#stratagem-overwhelming-generosity">OVERWHELMING GENEROSITY</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="virulent-vectorium" data-term-title="Virulent Vectorium" data-term-summary="Take and Hold, 3DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#virulent-vectorium-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#virulent-vectorium-rule">Virulent Vectorium</button> – Wargear Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">1CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Start of your Shooting phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>One <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-character" data-term-title="CHARACTER" data-term-summary="CHARACTER units use SAVE ROLLS, MORTAL WOUNDS and PRECISION.">CHARACTER</button> unit from your army.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Select one enemy unit visible to your unit. Until the end of the phase, each time a <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> unit from your army selects that enemy unit as the target of any ranged attacks, you can re-roll the dice to determine how many attacks a weapon equipped by a model in that unit makes.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-creeping-blight">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="creeping-blight" data-term-title="CREEPING BLIGHT" data-term-summary="WHEN: Your Shooting phase. TARGET: One DEATH GUARD INFANTRY unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-creeping-blight" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#stratagem-creeping-blight">CREEPING BLIGHT</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="virulent-vectorium" data-term-title="Virulent Vectorium" data-term-summary="Take and Hold, 3DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#virulent-vectorium-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#virulent-vectorium-rule">Virulent Vectorium</button> – Wargear Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">1CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Your Shooting phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>One <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-infantry" data-term-title="INFANTRY" data-term-summary="INFANTRY units use TERRAIN AND MOVEMENT, BENEFIT OF COVER and HIDDEN.">INFANTRY</button> unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an <button class="term-button" data-term="afflicted" data-term-title="Afflicted" data-term-summary="While an enemy unit is Afflicted, subtract 1 from its models’ Toughness and apply the effect of your chosen Plague to that unit.">Afflicted</button> unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll and you can re-roll the Wound roll.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section></div>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="virulent-vectorium-enhancements" data-track="virulent-vectorium-enhancements">
<h4 class="detachment-part-title">Enhancements</h4>
<div class="detachment-content">
<article class="enhancement surface" id="enhancement-daemon-weapon-of-nurgle">
<div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div>
<h4>
<button class="term-button" data-term="daemon-weapon-of-nurgle" data-term-title="Daemon Weapon of Nurgle" data-term-summary="DEATH GUARD model only. Each time the bearer makes a melee attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#enhancement-daemon-weapon-of-nurgle" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#enhancement-daemon-weapon-of-nurgle">Daemon Weapon of Nurgle</button> - 10 pts</h4>
<p>
<button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> model only. Each time the bearer makes a melee attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit.</p>
</article>
<article class="enhancement surface" id="enhancement-furnace-of-plagues">
<div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div>
<h4>
<button class="term-button" data-term="furnace-of-plagues" data-term-title="Furnace of Plagues" data-term-summary="DEATH GUARD model only. Add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of the bearers melee weapons, and the bearer’s melee weapons have the [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] ability." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#enhancement-furnace-of-plagues" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#enhancement-furnace-of-plagues">Furnace of Plagues</button> - 25 pts</h4>
<p>
<button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> model only. Add 1 to the Strength and Attacks characteristics of the bearers melee weapons, and the bearer’s melee weapons have the [<button class="term-button" data-term="core-devastating-wounds" data-term-title="[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]" data-term-summary="When an attack with DEVASTATING WOUNDS scores a Critical Wound, the target suffers mortal wounds equal to the weapon's Damage characteristic. Excess mortal wounds are lost." data-full-rule-path="books/core-rules/reader/core-abilities.html#rule-24-10">DEVASTATING WOUNDS</button>] ability.</p>
</article>
<article class="enhancement surface" id="enhancement-arch-contaminator">
<div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div>
<h4>
<button class="term-button" data-term="arch-contaminator" data-term-title="Arch Contaminator" data-term-summary="DEATH GUARD model only. While the bearer’s unit is within range of an objective marker you control, each time a model in the bearer’s unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the Wound roll." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#enhancement-arch-contaminator" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#enhancement-arch-contaminator">Arch Contaminator</button> - 25 pts</h4>
<p>
<button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> model only. While the bearer’s unit is within range of an objective marker you control, each time a model in the bearer’s unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the Wound roll.</p>
</article>
<article class="enhancement surface" id="enhancement-revolting-regeneration">
<div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div>
<h4>
<button class="term-button" data-term="revolting-regeneration" data-term-title="Revolting Regeneration" data-term-summary="DEATH GUARD model only. The bearer has the Feel No Pain 5+ ability." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#enhancement-revolting-regeneration" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/virulent-vectorium.html#enhancement-revolting-regeneration">Revolting Regeneration</button> - 20 pts</h4>
