<button class="term-button" data-term="term-malignant-plaguecaster" data-term-title="Malignant Plaguecaster" data-term-summary="M 5&quot; · T 6 · Sv 3+ · W 4 · Ld 6+ · OC 1" data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#unit-malignant-plaguecaster" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/malignant-plaguecaster.html#unit-malignant-plaguecaster">MALIGNANT PLAGUECASTER</button> only. While an enemy unit is enfeebled by the bearer’s Pestilent Fallout ability, that unit is also <button class="term-button" data-term="afflicted" data-term-title="Afflicted" data-term-summary="While an enemy unit is Afflicted, subtract 1 from its models’ Toughness and apply the effect of your chosen Plague to that unit.">Afflicted</button>.</p>
</article>
