<p>
<button class="term-button" data-term="term-plague-surgeon" data-term-title="Plague Surgeon" data-term-summary="M 5&quot; · T 6 · Sv 3+ · W 4 · Ld 6+ · OC 1" data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#unit-plague-surgeon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/plague-surgeon.html#unit-plague-surgeon">PLAGUE SURGEON</button> only. Each time the bearer uses its <button class="term-button" data-term="ability-tainted-narthecium-01ba1bd" data-term-title="Tainted Narthecium" data-term-summary="While this model is leading a unit, in your Command phase, you can return 1 destroyed Bodyguard model to that unit." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#plague-surgeon-ability-tainted-narthecium" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/plague-surgeon.html#plague-surgeon-ability-tainted-narthecium">Tainted Narthecium</button> ability, you can return up to D3 destroyed models to the bearer’s unit (instead of 1).</p>
</article>
<article class="enhancement surface" id="enhancement-cornucophagus">
