      <h2>Tallyband Summoners</h2>
      <div class="related-kind" data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="tallyband-summoners-stratagems" data-track="tallyband-summoners-stratagems">
<h4 class="detachment-part-title">Stratagems</h4>
<div class="detachment-content">
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-persistent-pests">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="persistent-pests" data-term-title="PERSISTENT PESTS" data-term-summary="WHEN: Any phase. TARGET: One NURGLINGS unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can target that unit with this Stratagem even though it was just destroyed." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-persistent-pests" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/tallyband-summoners.html#stratagem-persistent-pests">PERSISTENT PESTS</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="tallyband-summoners" data-term-title="Tallyband Summoners" data-term-summary="Disruption, 2DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#tallyband-summoners-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/tallyband-summoners.html#tallyband-summoners-rule">Tallyband Summoners</button> – Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">1CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Any phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>One <button class="term-button" data-term="term-nurglings" data-term-title="Nurglings" data-term-summary="M 5&quot; · T 3 · Sv 7+ · W 4 · Ld 8+ · OC 0 · Inv 5+" data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#unit-nurglings" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/nurglings.html#unit-nurglings">NURGLINGS</button> unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can target that unit with this Stratagem even though it was just destroyed.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength and with its full wounds remaining.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>RESTRICTIONS</b>
<br>You can only use this Stratagem once per battle.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-clutching-corruption">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="clutching-corruption" data-term-title="CLUTCHING CORRUPTION" data-term-summary="WHEN: Fight phase. TARGET: One DEATH GUARD unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-clutching-corruption" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/tallyband-summoners.html#stratagem-clutching-corruption">CLUTCHING CORRUPTION</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="tallyband-summoners" data-term-title="Tallyband Summoners" data-term-summary="Disruption, 2DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#tallyband-summoners-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/tallyband-summoners.html#tallyband-summoners-rule">Tallyband Summoners</button> – Battle Tactic Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">1CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Fight phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>One <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-death-guard" data-term-title="DEATH GUARD" data-term-summary="Rules that specify DEATH GUARD apply only to models or units with this keyword.">DEATH GUARD</button> unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-plague-legions" data-term-title="PLAGUE LEGIONS" data-term-summary="Rules that specify PLAGUE LEGIONS apply only to models or units with this keyword.">PLAGUE LEGIONS</button> units from your army, you can re-roll the Hit roll.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-all-is-rot">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="all-is-rot" data-term-title="ALL IS ROT" data-term-summary="WHEN: Your Shooting phase. TARGET: One PLAGUE LEGIONS unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-all-is-rot" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/tallyband-summoners.html#stratagem-all-is-rot">ALL IS ROT</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="tallyband-summoners" data-term-title="Tallyband Summoners" data-term-summary="Disruption, 2DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#tallyband-summoners-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/tallyband-summoners.html#tallyband-summoners-rule">Tallyband Summoners</button> – Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">1CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Your Shooting phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>One <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-plague-legions" data-term-title="PLAGUE LEGIONS" data-term-summary="Rules that specify PLAGUE LEGIONS apply only to models or units with this keyword.">PLAGUE LEGIONS</button> unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Until the end of the phase, enemy units are not considered to be within Engagement Range of your unit for the purposes of selecting targets of ranged weapons. Until the end of the phase, each time an enemy model loses a wound, while that model’s unit is within Engagement Range of your unit, roll one D6: on a 5+, your unit suffers 1 mortal wound after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-fleshy-avalanche">
<div class="stratagem-head">
<div>
<h3>
<button class="term-button" data-term="fleshy-avalanche" data-term-title="FLESHY AVALANCHE" data-term-summary="WHEN: Your Movement phase or your Charge phase. TARGET: One PLAGUE LEGIONS MONSTER unit from your army that has not been selected to move or charge this phase." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#stratagem-fleshy-avalanche" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/tallyband-summoners.html#stratagem-fleshy-avalanche">FLESHY AVALANCHE</button>
</h3>
<span class="stratagem-type">
<button class="term-button" data-term="tallyband-summoners" data-term-title="Tallyband Summoners" data-term-summary="Disruption, 2DP." data-full-rule-path="books/death-guard/reader.html#tallyband-summoners-rule" data-mobile-rule-path="books/death-guard/mobile/tallyband-summoners.html#tallyband-summoners-rule">Tallyband Summoners</button> – Strategic Ploy Stratagem</span>
</div>
<div class="cp">1CP</div>
</div>
<p class="field">
<b>WHEN</b>
<br>Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>TARGET</b>
<br>One <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-plague-legions" data-term-title="PLAGUE LEGIONS" data-term-summary="Rules that specify PLAGUE LEGIONS apply only to models or units with this keyword.">PLAGUE LEGIONS</button> <button class="term-button" data-term="keyword-monster" data-term-title="MONSTER" data-term-summary="MONSTER units use HAZARD ROLLS, CLOSE-QUARTERS SHOOTING, TERRAIN AND MOVEMENT and MOVING MONSTERS AND VEHICLES (+1 more).">MONSTER</button> unit from your army that has not been selected to move or charge this phase.</p>
<p class="field">
<b>EFFECT</b>
<br>Until the end of the phase, each time your unit makes a Normal, Advance or Charge move, it can move horizontally through terrain features.</p>
</article>
<article class="stratagem surface" id="stratagem-avatars-of-decay">
<div class="stratagem-head">
